"Goldbush is a planet with corrupted patches, where most young knights have trained lately."
"Knights call it 'baby knight hell': chaos, demons and mutated monstrosities."
"Knight squads work there to clear a patch; some hunt demons, some repair the land, some assist."
"Communication with Goldbush is less simple than with the Triplanets."
"Some squads stay there longer than others; older knights are 'too old for Goldbush'."
"Goldbush has a single settlement and few buildings; ground is everywhere."
"A young knight from Purl, Yaril-honn's brother, went missing there."
